    "detailed_description": "\u300aOupai Battle\u300b is a first-person visual novel featuring three main characters and over 20 secondary characters. The story progresses through mouse clicks, and players can make choices at crucial points to experience different storylines.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823420/extras/fa555a9f502f6293d8f900656a93c279.avif?t=1722951691\" width=290 height=162 /></span><br>Qingyi Long, the student council president, who is troubled by her future.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823420/extras/250ad0568b102cfe46254bdc5b37adbc.avif?t=1722951691\" width=332 height=218 /></span><br>Luhua, a mysterious immortal, with a hot dog that will never return.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823420/extras/7b8be40adc10789746682fcd725d7707.avif?t=1722951691\" width=332 height=218 /></span><br>Hua, the domineering class monitor, is about to embark on a legendary journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823420/extras/8f408f1fc6d85c403a6ce493a46aacba.avif?t=1722951691\" width=290 height=218 /></span><br>There are also 20 other characters and a total of over 400 CGs waiting for you to explore.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823420/extras/\u672a55555555\u6807\u9898-1.png?t=1722951691\" width=290 height=218 /></span><br>400 CG puzzles await your challenge\uff01<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823420/extras/73c70e850cc632bab9ec145907eefd24.avif?t=1722951691\" width=450 height=218 /></span>",
